  "Delete account & data": "删除账户和数据",
  ", and complete the confirmation. The deletion is permanent.": "，并完成确认。删除不可撤销。",
  "The in-app deletion removes your Ceventic profile and authentication links together with routines, tasks, habits, workouts, progress, Athkar data, macro inputs, trusted-device records, preferences, and other account-owned tracker data stored by Ceventic.": "应用内删除会移除你的 Ceventic 资料及登录关联，以及日常计划、任务、习惯、训练、进展、祈念数据、营养输入、可信设备记录、偏好和其他由 Ceventic 保存的账户跟踪数据。",
  "If you cannot access your account": "如果无法访问账户",
