  "Ceventic account deletion request": "Ceventic 账户删除请求",
  "We may ask for reasonable information needed to verify that the request belongs to the account owner before deleting data.": "删除数据前，我们可能要求提供合理信息，以核实请求来自账户所有者。",
  "What may remain temporarily": "可能暂时保留的内容",
  "Short-lived infrastructure, security, anti-abuse, or backup records may persist for a limited period where technically necessary to protect the service, investigate abuse, or complete backup rotation. They are not kept for normal product use after deletion.": "为保护服务、调查滥用或完成备份轮换，必要的基础设施、安全、防滥用或备份记录可能在有限时间内保留。删除后不会将其用于正常产品功能。",
  "Google account": "Google 账户",
  "Deleting Ceventic removes the Ceventic account and its Google sign-in link from Ceventic. It does not delete your Google account.": "删除 Ceventic 账户会移除其 Google 登录关联，不会删除你的 Google 账户。",
  "Terms of Service": "服务条款",
  "These terms govern your use of the Ceventic System beta application and related services.": "这些条款适用于 Ceventic System 测试版及相关服务的使用。",
  "1. Beta service": "1. 测试版服务",
  "Ceventic is currently offered as a beta product. Features may change, be improved, or occasionally be unavailable while the service is being developed.": "Ceventic 目前以测试版提供。开发期间功能可能调整、改进或偶尔无法使用。",
  "2. Your account": "2. 你的账户",
  "You are responsible for keeping your sign-in credentials secure and for activity performed through your account. Do not attempt to access another user's account or bypass Ceventic's security controls.": "你有责任保护登录凭据并对账户活动负责。请勿尝试访问他人账户或绕过 Ceventic 安全控制。",
  "3. Your content": "3. 你的内容",
  "You keep ownership of the routines, habits, workouts, notes, Athkar customizations, nutrition inputs, and other content you enter. You give Ceventic permission to process that content only as needed to provide and operate the service.": "你保留输入的日常计划、习惯、训练、笔记、祈念自定义内容、营养数据等内容的所有权，仅授权 Ceventic 在提供和运营服务所必需的范围内处理这些内容。",
  "4. Acceptable use": "4. 可接受的使用",
  "Do not abuse the service, interfere with its operation, probe or attack its infrastructure, automate excessive requests, distribute malware, or use Ceventic in a way that violates applicable law.": "请勿滥用服务、干扰运行、探测或攻击基础设施、发送过量自动请求、传播恶意软件或违法使用 Ceventic。",
  "5. Health and fitness information": "5. 健康和健身信息",
  "Ceventic can help you organize workouts, habits, nutrition targets, and personal progress. It is not medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. You remain responsible for decisions about your health, training, and nutrition.": "Ceventic 可帮助规划训练、习惯、营养目标和个人进展，但不提供医疗建议、诊断或治疗。你仍需对健康、训练和营养决策负责。",
  "6. Availability and changes": "6. 可用性和变更",
  "Because this is a beta, we do not promise uninterrupted availability or that every feature will remain unchanged. We may modify or discontinue beta features when necessary for security, reliability, or product development.": "由于是测试版，我们不保证持续可用或所有功能保持不变。出于安全、可靠性或产品开发需要，可能修改或停止测试功能。",
  "7. No paid subscription yet": "7. 暂无付费订阅",
  "The current public beta is free. If paid plans are introduced later, pricing and any additional terms will be presented before a user is charged.": "当前公开测试版免费。若未来推出付费方案，将在收费前展示价格和附加条款。",
  "8. Termination and deletion": "8. 终止和删除",
  "We may restrict access when an account is used to abuse the service or compromise other users or Ceventic's systems. You may stop using Ceventic at any time and may permanently delete your account through the in-app account settings.": "如账户被用于滥用服务或危及其他用户或 Ceventic 系统，我们可能限制访问。你可随时停止使用，并在应用账户设置中永久删除账户。",
  "9. Changes to these terms": "9. 条款变更",
  "These terms may be updated as the beta evolves. The date at the top of this page shows the latest revision.": "随着测试版发展，这些条款可能更新。页面顶部日期为最新修订时间。",
  "Privacy Policy": "隐私政策",
  "This policy explains what Ceventic processes during the beta, why it is needed, and the choices available to users.": "本政策说明 Ceventic 测试期间处理的数据、处理原因及用户可用的选择。",
  "1. Information Ceventic processes": "1. Ceventic 处理的信息",
  "Account information:": "账户信息：",
  "your email address, display name, authentication provider information, and internal account identifiers.": "电子邮箱、显示名称、登录提供方信息和内部账户标识。",
  "Content you enter:": "你输入的内容：",
  "routines and tasks, habits, workouts and exercise notes, progress records, Athkar progress/custom entries, and nutrition or macro-calculator inputs.": "日常计划、任务、习惯、训练及笔记、进展记录、祈念进度及自定义内容、营养或营养计算器输入。",
  "Security information:": "安全信息：",
  "session/authentication records, hashed trusted-device tokens, device labels, verification state, and bounded rate-limit counters used to protect the service.": "会话及身份验证记录、可信设备令牌的哈希值、设备标签、验证状态和用于保护服务的有界限流计数。",
  "Technical information:": "技术信息：",
  "hosting and infrastructure providers may process standard request, device, network, and diagnostic information needed to deliver and secure the service.": "托管及基础设施提供方可能处理为提供及保护服务所需的常规请求、设备、网络及诊断信息。",
  "2. How information is used": "2. 信息的使用方式",
  "We use this information to authenticate you, save and synchronize your personal system, calculate progress/statistics, provide the features you request, prevent abuse, troubleshoot failures, and maintain service security and reliability.": "我们使用这些信息进行身份验证、保存及同步个人系统、计算进度和统计、提供所需功能、防止滥用、排查故障并维护安全与可靠性。",
  "3. Google sign-in": "3. Google 登录",
  "If you choose Google sign-in, Ceventic uses the basic identity information required to sign you in, such as your Google account identifier, email address, and profile information supplied by the authentication flow. Ceventic does not request access to your Gmail, Google Drive, contacts, or calendar for this sign-in feature.": "使用 Google 登录时，Ceventic 会使用登录所需的基本身份信息，例如 Google 账户标识、邮箱和登录流程提供的资料。此功能不会请求访问 Gmail、Google Drive、联系人或日历。",
  "4. Service providers": "4. 服务提供方",
  "Ceventic relies on Convex for backend, database, and authentication services; Vercel for the web release and public pages; and Google when you choose Google OAuth. Those providers process information according to their own terms and privacy practices while providing their services to Ceventic.": "Ceventic 使用 Convex 提供后端、数据库及身份验证，使用 Vercel 提供网页及公开页面，在你选择 Google OAuth 时使用 Google。这些提供方依其条款及隐私惯例处理信息。",
  "5. Selling data and advertising": "5. 数据出售与广告",
  "Ceventic does not sell your personal information. The current beta does not use your personal tracker data for third-party advertising.": "Ceventic 不出售个人信息。当前测试版不会将个人跟踪数据用于第三方广告。",
  "6. Data security": "6. 数据安全",
  "We use authenticated backend access checks, per-user ownership validation, input limits, rate limits, restrictive web/desktop security policies, and encrypted HTTPS connections. No online service can guarantee absolute security.": "我们采用后端身份验证访问检查、用户数据所有权验证、输入及请求限制、严格的网页和桌面安全策略及 HTTPS 加密连接。任何在线服务都无法保证绝对安全。",
  "7. Retention and deletion": "7. 保留与删除",
  "Your account and tracker data are retained while needed to provide Ceventic. You can permanently delete your account from": "账户和跟踪数据将在提供 Ceventic 所需期间保留。你可永久删除账户，路径为",
  ". Ceventic then removes the account and its account-owned tracker data from the live application database.": "。随后 Ceventic 会从应用的在线数据库中删除账户及所属跟踪数据。",
  "If you cannot sign in, use the public": "如果无法登录，请使用公开的",
  "account deletion page": "账户删除页面",
  "to request deletion. Limited security, anti-abuse, infrastructure, or backup records may remain temporarily where technically or legally necessary.": "提交删除请求。出于技术或法律需要，部分安全、防滥用、基础设施或备份记录可能暂时保留。",
  "8. Email verification during beta": "8. 测试期间的邮箱验证",
  "The initial free beta may allow password accounts without email verification while Ceventic's transactional email system is not enabled. Google sign-in relies on Google's identity flow. Additional email verification and recovery controls may be introduced as the service develops.": "在事务邮件系统启用前，初始免费测试版可能允许无需邮箱验证的密码账户。Google 登录依赖 Google 身份流程。随着服务发展，可能增加邮箱验证及恢复控制。",
  "9. Children": "9. 儿童",
  "Ceventic is not designed as a service directed specifically to children. Users must meet any age requirements that apply to them under their local law and app-store account rules.": "Ceventic 并非专门面向儿童的服务。用户须符合当地法律及应用商店账户规则的年龄要求。",
  "10. Changes to this policy": "10. 政策变更",
  "We may update this policy as Ceventic adds features, providers, or paid plans. The latest revision date is shown at the top of this page.": "随着功能、提供方或付费方案的增加，本政策可能更新。页面顶部显示最新修订日期。",
