  "How these numbers work": "这些数值如何计算",
  "Routines use completed tasks divided by total tasks in saved daily snapshots (or today's live checklist until saved). Workouts use checked exercises divided by exercises in that day's logged sessions. No workout record means no assumption about whether training was planned. Habits include all currently active habits that existed on that date, including unmarked ones; deleting or deactivating a habit changes this view of its history. A day with no habit entries is shown as unrecorded. The overall average weights each recorded day equally, not each chart bar. No combined “life score” is calculated.": "日常计划按已保存每日快照中的已完成任务占比计算，保存前使用今天的实时清单。训练按当天已记录训练中的已勾选动作占比计算。无训练记录不代表当天原本计划训练。习惯包括当日已存在且当前仍启用的所有习惯，包括未勾选项目；删除或停用会改变历史视图。无习惯记录的日期显示为未记录。总体平均值对每个有记录的日期赋予相同权重，而非每个图表柱。不会计算综合生活评分。",
